-- examples/checks/agg-datastrat-budget-check.rofl — agg_datastrat_budget: the
-- budget cuts the evaluation of agg-datastrat-sheet.rofl between two layers of
-- its cells. A cell with a value has the sheet's value, never the total of the
-- cells below it that had come out when the wall fell; the cut is a hole on the
-- world, and the cells above the wall have no value at all.
adb_wrong(C) :- value(C, V), not ads_expect(C, V).
alarm(adb_wrong).
